# /brag run artifacts: raw captures and review snapshots are regenerable and
# bulky. The composition under brag-output*/composition/ is self-contained —
# it carries every asset index.html references — so runs stay reproducible.
brag-output*/source-shots/
brag-output*/composition/snapshots/
